iginal":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YQt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9a364eaa-c1e4-4171-85bb-bdf27d460086","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"よくスニペット系プラグインの placeholder 仮選択状態に使われているというのがありますｗ","ts":"1615806715.027300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BSh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ce9f3ef5-1322-4323-b61e-edd2fa0f9968","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"個人的にはselectmode自体使わんのだけどもねw","ts":"1615806680.025500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ffAZZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"22d4ee7a-e1f5-4599-b134-3baefc430a3e","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"手元でログを出して確認しましたが、op_deleteが呼ばれてました","ts":"1615806662.024900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1oB61"}]},{"client_msg_id":"481188c4-6e2e-4c34-b96c-ad1d478caf7e","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"この挙動必要だと思ったことが1回もない","ts":"1615806662.024800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pnK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c41b2a46-e35b-45bd-b289-b0d0a4ea3284","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"select modeの入力開始でレジスタ壊れるのは微妙だよなとは思う","ts":"1615806635.023700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fdv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cb3022b2-6ae0-4d7d-bfeb-5b2c3cf69f14","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"pasteについてはプラグインを使ったり一応回避できないことはないけれど、セレクトモードは回避不可能なのも困るところ","ts":"1615806633.023600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JruK6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d776b0e6-710c-4878-80b1-efe952b01646","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"Vimとしてはdelete\u0026amp;some operationで実装している以上、deleteがregisterに影響をあたえるのはしかたないし、かといってデフォの挙動を変えるのは互換性の観点からまぁ受け入れられにくいかなという感じ。","ts":"1615806525.021600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cgA/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bd2de350-440f-4278-89b9-63db300ca525","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"visual-mode はわかりますが、select-mode のこの挙動で register を更新するのは使いにくくないだろうか？みたいな感じです。","ts":"1615806330.019600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X3d+q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3a065c42-9e90-4af1-966a-3f916ffc7049","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"これはバグというよりは、挙動が使いにくい。みたいなニュアンスの話かと思います。\n```\nset clipboard=\ncall setreg(v:register, 'register')\ncall setline(1, 'aiueo')\ncall feedkeys(\"1G1|v1G5|\\\u0026lt;C-g\u0026gt;a\\\u0026lt;Esc\u0026gt;\", 'x')\nechomsg getreg(v:register)```\nこれで `register` ではなく、`aiueo` が出力されるのですが、この動作は　select-mode の特徴である「select-mode 中に何らかの文字を入力すると、select 中の文字を削除して insert-mode に入る」という動きの際に register が変化するということを表したサンプルです。","ts":"1615806269.019000","edited":{"user":"U8R597E9H","ts":"1615806369.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lX1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"30ed428a-7298-4c09-80c5-8b15388f25a9","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"コードはops.cのL1683です","ts":"1615806191.017700","thread_ts":"1615806191.017700","reply_count":4,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cCG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c412ff3c-9bc1-4dce-b967-ae097fd8e68e","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"破壊されるのは無名レジスタ","ts":"1615806174.017000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GjULI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9069b126-0015-4b47-a264-9086c4c542e6","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"破壊されるレジスタってドレ? \u0026amp; 確認したコードのGitHub上でのURLプリーズ","ts":"1615805351.016200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bwq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7b8dcfa8-996d-451a-b2e5-c64f4d99916c","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"やはり、op_deleteが呼ばれてる","ts":"1615797941.015500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BhF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"734c64d7-5be6-45a8-8fc4-35617d3ab253","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"実相を確認。","ts":"1615797925.014900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5L2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5c08c980-6735-4902-97cd-568b84603114","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"内部ではdeleteになっている？？","ts":"1615797179.014600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Me/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2e356b99-44c1-4be6-83a8-f0e8c621734b","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"deleteの時に破壊されるのはよいけど、Windowsでもペーストでは破壊されないはず","ts":"1615797169.014200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EYGW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ca6ebe7d-0352-41f4-b013-5db09014db21","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"スニペットプラグインにはこの挙動がじゃまだし、テキストのペーストの時にも邪魔。\nこれを回避するためoperator-replaceなるものが発明されてるのですが標準で何かあっても良いのではと考えるわけです","ts":"1615797125.013500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OUE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9a1db8ca-d9ee-409d-896b-6d304f767229","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"visual modeやselect modeでテキストを置き換えるとレジスタが破壊されるのですが、これをどうにか無効化できないかかんがえています","ts":"1615797043.011600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nTW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"126ebe15-7ba0-439d-bc14-67191a731186","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/hrsh7th/vim-vsnip/issues/175|https://github.com/hrsh7th/vim-vsnip/issues/175\u003e","ts":"1615796995.010200","attachments